PATH COEFFICIENTS
------------------------------------------------------------------------ 
  a  path (treat -> emo):        1.467
  b  path (emo -> p_harm):       0.464
  c' path (direct effect):      -0.072
  ab      (indirect effect):     0.680  95% CI [0.268, 1.091]
  Minimum weight, mediator model:            0.18
  Observations with weight 0, outcome model: 1 of 265

INTERPRETATION
------------------------------------------------------------------------ 
  The indirect effect ab is the product of the a and b paths.
  MM-estimators downweight outliers, providing estimates that are
  resistant to influential observations while maintaining high
  efficiency when data are well-behaved.
  
  Compare these estimates with 04_sem_mediation.R (ML via lavaan).
  The difference between the two shows how much the observations
  that MM-estimation downweights move the ML estimates.
